{section: 1}
[Dm]Wein aa Ramallah, wein aa Ramallah, || Where to? To Ramallah! Where to? To Ramallah!
[Dm]wilfee yamsafer wein aa Ramallah, || My love, you traveller, where to? To Ramallah!
[Gm]matakhaf min allah, matakhaf min allah, || Don't you fear God? Don't you fear God?
[Dm]saragat eglaiby [A7]matakhaf min al[Dm]lah. || You stole my heart, don't you fear God?

{section: 2}
[Dm]Wein aa Ramallah, wein aa Ramallah, || Where to? To Ramallah! Where to? To Ramallah!
[Dm]wilfee yamsafer wein aa Ramallah, || My love, you traveller, where to? To Ramallah!
[Gm]dab galby wallah, dab galby wallah, || My heart melted, I swear, my heart melted, I swear,
[Dm]yom ill wadaatak [A7]dab galby wal[Dm]lah. || the day I said goodbye to you, my heart melted, I swear.

{section: 3}
[~Dm]Wain ya habibi, wain ya habibi, || Where, my love? Where, my love?
[~Dm]tariknee w raiyeh [~A7]wain ya ha[~Dm]bibi, || You leave me and go away, where, my love?
[~Gm]hathi w naseeby, hathi w naseeby, || This is my fate, this is my fate,
[~Dm]raytak min allah [~A7]hathi w na[~Dm]seeby. || I saw you as God's gift, this is my fate.
